{"title":"Career Roadmap: HR Executive","role":"HR Executive","summary":"A BA in Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology can provide a useful foundation for HR because HR involves understanding people, communication, behaviour, motivation, conflict and workplace relationships.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build psychology-based people skills, HR fundamentals, recruitment, employee engagement, HR operations, analytics and organizational behaviour expertise"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology can provide a useful foundation for HR because HR involves understanding people, communication, behaviour, motivation, conflict and workplace relationships."},{"type":"p","text":"However, psychology knowledge alone is not enough for a professional HR career. The student should deliberately add:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Psychology","Organizational Behaviour","HR Fundamentals","Recruitment","Employee Relations","Performance Management","HR Operations","HR Analytics","Labour/Employment Awareness","HR Technology","Internship"]},{"type":"p","text":"For most graduates, HR Executive is an early-career role, typically reached after an HR internship or entry-level HR/People Operations position."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR Intern","HR Assistant/HR Associate","HR Executive","Senior HR Executive","HR Manager","Senior HR Manager","HR Business Partner/HR Head"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Psychology + communication foundation"},{"text":"Applied psychology, behaviour, communication"},{"text":"Psychology projects"},{"text":"Studying psychology without business context"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"HR fundamentals"},{"text":"Recruitment, HR operations, organizational behaviour"},{"text":"Recruitment simulation"},{"text":"No practical HR exposure"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Professional HR skills"},{"text":"Performance, employee relations, HR analytics"},{"text":"HR dashboard + internship"},{"text":"No HR tools/data skills"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"HR specialization"},{"text":"People analytics, HR technology, workforce management"},{"text":"Internship + capstone"},{"text":"No measurable HR portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to psychology"},{"text":"Applied psychology"},{"text":"Human behaviour"},{"text":"Communication skills"},{"text":"Sociology fundamentals"},{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Excel basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Developmental psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Counselling fundamentals"},{"text":"Interpersonal communication"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Organizational behaviour"},{"text":"Industrial psychology"},{"text":"HR management fundamentals"},{"text":"Recruitment and selection"},{"text":"Job analysis"},{"text":"Job descriptions"},{"text":"Interviewing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Training and development"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Compensation fundamentals"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Workplace communication"},{"text":"Conflict management"},{"text":"HR documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR analytics"},{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"HR technology"},{"text":"Labour/employment-law awareness"},{"text":"Diversity and inclusion"},{"text":"People metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR internship"},{"text":"HR analytics project"},{"text":"Recruitment project"},{"text":"Employee engagement project"},{"text":"Capstone"},{"text":"Resume and interview preparation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a 4-year Honours programme, use the additional year for advanced HR analytics, organizational psychology, research and a substantial internship."}]},{"heading":"Psychology Foundation for HR","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The psychology specialization becomes valuable when connected to workplace behaviour."},{"type":"h","text":"Social Psychology"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Group behaviour"},{"text":"Social influence"},{"text":"Attitudes"},{"text":"Interpersonal relationships"},{"text":"Group decision-making"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Workplace communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Personality Psychology"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personality traits"},{"text":"Individual differences"},{"text":"Behavioural tendencies"},{"text":"Work preferences"},{"text":"Team dynamics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid assuming personality tests can independently determine whether someone is suitable for a job. Selection assessments require appropriate validation and professional practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Motivation"},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intrinsic motivation"},{"text":"Extrinsic motivation"},{"text":"Goal-setting"},{"text":"Recognition"},{"text":"Rewards"},{"text":"Employee engagement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Counselling Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful HR applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Conflict handling"},{"text":"Employee conversations"},{"text":"Workplace support"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, an HR professional should not present ordinary HR training as qualification to provide clinical psychological treatment or therapy."}]},{"heading":"Organizational Psychology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This should become one of the student's strongest areas."},{"type":"h","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Organizational behaviour"},{"text":"Workplace motivation"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Team dynamics"},{"text":"Organizational culture"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Job satisfaction"},{"text":"Workplace stress"},{"text":"Organizational change"},{"text":"Conflict"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Psychological safety"},{"text":"Employee experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Individual","Team","Manager","Organization","Culture","Performance"]}]},{"heading":"HR Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn the complete employee lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Workforce Planning","Recruitment","Selection","Onboarding","Performance","Learning","Compensation","Engagement","Career Development","Retention","Exit"]},{"type":"h","text":"HR Functions"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Talent acquisition"},{"text":"HR operations"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Learning & development"},{"text":"Compensation & benefits"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"HR administration"},{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"HR analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Recruitment & Talent Acquisition","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important entry-level HR skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Job Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Job purpose"},{"text":"Responsibilities"},{"text":"Required skills"},{"text":"Qualifications"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Competencies"},{"text":"Reporting structure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Job Description"},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Job title"},{"text":"Role summary"},{"text":"Responsibilities"},{"text":"Required qualifications"},{"text":"Technical skills"},{"text":"Behavioural competencies"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Employment type"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recruitment Funnel"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Job Description","Sourcing","Screening","Interview","Assessment","Selection","Offer","Onboarding"]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn sourcing through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LinkedIn"},{"text":"Job portals"},{"text":"Employee referrals"},{"text":"Campus hiring"},{"text":"Recruitment agencies"},{"text":"Talent databases"}]}]},{"heading":"Interviewing Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop structured interviewing rather than informal questioning."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resume screening"},{"text":"Screening calls"},{"text":"Behavioural interviews"},{"text":"Competency-based interviews"},{"text":"Situational questions"},{"text":"STAR framework"},{"text":"Structured scoring"},{"text":"Interview documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example competency areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Adaptability"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Technical capability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand that selection decisions should be based on job-relevant, consistently evaluated criteria rather than stereotypes or personal assumptions."}]},{"heading":"Employee Onboarding","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Learn to design an onboarding process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Offer","Documentation","Joining","Orientation","Policy Introduction","Team Introduction","Role Training","30/60/90-Day Follow-up"]},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Joining checklist"},{"text":"Employee documentation checklist"},{"text":"Orientation plan"},{"text":"New-hire survey"},{"text":"30/60/90-day framework"}]}]},{"heading":"Performance Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"KRAs"},{"text":"Objectives"},{"text":"Goal-setting"},{"text":"Performance reviews"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Development plans"},{"text":"Performance improvement plans"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Goal","Measurement","Feedback","Development","Review"]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Performance appraisal"},{"text":"Employee development"}]}]},{"heading":"Employee Engagement","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how organizations measure and improve employee experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Important areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement surveys"},{"text":"Pulse surveys"},{"text":"Employee feedback"},{"text":"Recognition"},{"text":"Manager effectiveness"},{"text":"Career development"},{"text":"Workplace culture"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Employee experience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement score"},{"text":"Participation rate"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Internal mobility"},{"text":"Employee satisfaction"},{"text":"Training completion"}]}]},{"heading":"HR Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest career-enhancing skills for a psychology graduate."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic HR Metrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Attrition Rate"},{"type":"h","text":"Other metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time to hire"},{"text":"Cost per hire"},{"text":"Offer acceptance rate"},{"text":"Recruitment conversion"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Training completion"},{"text":"Employee retention"},{"text":"Internal mobility"},{"text":"Performance distribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Power BI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Then learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"HR dashboards"}]}]},{"heading":"HR Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand modern HR systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HRIS"},{"text":"ATS"},{"text":"Payroll systems"},{"text":"Performance management systems"},{"text":"Learning management systems"},{"text":"Employee engagement platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples of platforms worth becoming familiar with include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workday"},{"text":"SAP SuccessFactors"},{"text":"Oracle HCM"},{"text":"Zoho People"},{"text":"Darwinbox"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tool availability and employer preferences vary, so prioritize understanding HR workflows over collecting certificates for many systems."}]},{"heading":"Labour & Employment Awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An HR professional needs working knowledge of employment regulations applicable to the organization."},{"type":"h","text":"Study concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employment contracts"},{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Wages"},{"text":"Workplace safety"},{"text":"Employee benefits"},{"text":"Grievance handling"},{"text":"Disciplinary procedures"},{"text":"Termination processes"},{"text":"Workplace harassment prevention"},{"text":"Employee documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-focused HR careers, students should keep their knowledge aligned with current applicable labour and employment requirements, because regulations and implementation details can change."}]},{"heading":"Workplace Counselling & Employee Support","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The counselling specialization can be useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee conversations"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Manager support"},{"text":"Employee assistance referrals"},{"text":"Workplace wellbeing initiatives"}]},{"type":"h","text":"But distinguish:"},{"type":"h","text":"HR support ≠ clinical counselling/psychotherapy"},{"type":"p","text":"Serious mental-health concerns should be referred to appropriately qualified professionals."}]},{"heading":"Neuropsychology — How It Can Help HR","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Neuropsychology is less directly relevant to general HR than organizational/industrial psychology."},{"type":"p","text":"However, it can provide useful understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cognition"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Memory"},{"text":"Decision-making"},{"text":"Human performance"},{"text":"Cognitive workload"},{"text":"Workplace accessibility"},{"text":"Neurodiversity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential niche areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Workplace accessibility"},{"text":"Neurodiversity programmes"},{"text":"Employee experience"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Occupational research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a conventional HR career, however, the student should prioritize organizational psychology and HR management over advanced neuropsychology."}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Recruitment & Selection System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a fictional recruitment process including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Job description"},{"text":"Candidate sourcing plan"},{"text":"Screening criteria"},{"text":"Interview questions"},{"text":"Interview scorecard"},{"text":"Selection matrix"},{"text":"Offer workflow"},{"text":"Onboarding checklist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Employee Engagement Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Use synthetic employee data to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Tenure"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Satisfaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Performance Management Framework"},{"type":"h","text":"Design a system containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee goals"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"KRAs"},{"text":"Review cycles"},{"text":"Feedback"},{"text":"Performance scores"},{"text":"Development plans"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"People Analytics & HR Management Platform"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a simulated HR system containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"Modules"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee database"},{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Onboarding"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"HR analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headcount"},{"text":"Hiring funnel"},{"text":"Time to hire"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Department performance"},{"text":"Training completion"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Diversity metrics where legally and ethically appropriate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use synthetic/de-identified data, particularly for sensitive employee information."}]},{"heading":"Tools to Learn","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Tools"],"rows":[[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"MS Word, Google Docs"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, Google Sheets"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Power BI"}],[{"text":"Database"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}],[{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Excel / R / Python"}],[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"LinkedIn, ATS concepts"}],[{"text":"HRIS"},{"text":"Workday/SAP/Oracle concepts"}],[{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Teams, Slack, Notion"}],[{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Trello, Asana"}],[{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"PowerPoint, Canva"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"LLM-based HR productivity workflows"}]]}]},{"heading":"Specialization Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"After the foundation, choose one or two:"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Talent Acquisition"},{"text":"Recruitment & hiring"}],[{"text":"HR Operations"},{"text":"Employee lifecycle & administration"}],[{"text":"Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Workplace behaviour"}],[{"text":"Learning & Development"},{"text":"Training & employee development"}],[{"text":"Employee Relations"},{"text":"Workplace relationships & conflict"}],[{"text":"Compensation & Benefits"},{"text":"Rewards and benefits"}],[{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"HR data & insights"}],[{"text":"Employee Experience"},{"text":"Engagement & workplace experience"}],[{"text":"HR Business Partnering"},{"text":"Business-aligned HR"}],[{"text":"Diversity & Inclusion"},{"text":"Inclusive workplace practices"}],[{"text":"HR Technology"},{"text":"HRIS, automation & systems"}],[{"text":"Talent Management"},{"text":"High-potential & succession planning"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For this degree pathway, Organizational Psychology + People Analytics is particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Internships to Target","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR departments"},{"text":"Recruitment agencies"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"IT companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"BPO/KPO organizations"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Healthcare organizations"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Talent-management firms"},{"text":"HR-tech companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong internship titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR Intern"},{"text":"HR Operations Intern"},{"text":"Recruitment Intern"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Intern"},{"text":"People Operations Intern"},{"text":"Employee Engagement Intern"},{"text":"HR Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Learning & Development Intern"},{"text":"Organizational Psychology Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful supplementary areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Resource Management"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition"},{"text":"HR Operations"},{"text":"Performance Management"},{"text":"Employee Engagement"},{"text":"Learning & Development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Industrial Psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural Science"},{"text":"Workplace Psychology"},{"text":"Counselling fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"People Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Conflict Management"},{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Business Communication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are supplementary; internship experience, HR projects, communication ability and practical HR-tool knowledge matter more for entry-level hiring."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"The graduate can target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR Intern"},{"text":"HR Assistant"},{"text":"HR Associate"},{"text":"HR Executive"},{"text":"HR Operations Executive"},{"text":"HR Coordinator"},{"text":"Recruitment Executive"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Executive"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Associate"},{"text":"Recruitment Coordinator"},{"text":"People Operations Associate"},{"text":"People Operations Executive"},{"text":"Employee Engagement Executive"},{"text":"HR Administration Executive"},{"text":"Learning & Development Coordinator"},{"text":"Training Coordinator"},{"text":"HR Analytics Associate"},{"text":"People Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Employee Experience Associate"},{"text":"Organizational Psychology Assistant"},{"text":"Talent Management Associate"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA/MSc Psychology"},{"text":"Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Industrial Psychology"},{"text":"Applied Psychology"},{"text":"Counselling Psychology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Human Resources"},{"text":"PGDM Human Resources"},{"text":"MSc Human Resource Management"},{"text":"Master's in Organizational Behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For someone specifically targeting corporate HR leadership, an MBA/PGDM in HR can be a particularly useful postgraduate route."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Options","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant master's programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Resource Management"},{"text":"Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Industrial/Organizational Psychology"},{"text":"Organizational Behaviour"},{"text":"People Analytics"},{"text":"Human Capital Management"},{"text":"Talent Management"},{"text":"Workplace Psychology"},{"text":"Applied Psychology"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Check each programme's prerequisites because psychology, HR and business master's programmes can have substantially different admission requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"General HR Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR Intern","HR Assistant / HR Associate","HR Executive","Senior HR Executive","HR Manager","Senior HR Manager","HR Business Partner / HR Lead","Head of HR / HR Director"]},{"type":"h","text":"Talent Acquisition Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recruitment Intern","Recruiter","Talent Acquisition Specialist","Senior TA","TA Manager","TA Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"People Analytics Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR Analytics Intern","People Analytics Associate","People Analyst","Senior People Analyst","People Analytics Manager","HR Analytics Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Organizational Psychology Track"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research/HR Assistant","Organizational Psychology Associate","OD/People Development Specialist","Senior Specialist","Organizational Development Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"HR is increasingly becoming a combination of people management + business + data + technology."},{"type":"h","text":"Important areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"People analytics"},{"text":"AI-assisted recruitment"},{"text":"Workforce planning"},{"text":"Skills-based hiring"},{"text":"Internal talent marketplaces"},{"text":"Employee experience"},{"text":"HR automation"},{"text":"AI governance in HR"},{"text":"Workplace wellbeing"},{"text":"Neurodiversity and inclusion"},{"text":"Learning personalization"},{"text":"Workforce reskilling"},{"text":"Organizational transformation"},{"text":"Human-AI collaboration"},{"text":"Predictive workforce analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI may automate parts of screening, scheduling, documentation and reporting, but HR professionals will continue to need strong judgment, communication, employee relations, organizational understanding and ethical decision-making."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Psychology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Applied psychology"},{"text":"Social psychology"},{"text":"Personality"},{"text":"Motivation"},{"text":"Organizational psychology"},{"text":"Behavioural science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"HR operations"},{"text":"Onboarding"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Learning & development"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"Talent management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"People analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HRIS"},{"text":"ATS"},{"text":"HR automation"},{"text":"AI tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"Conflict management"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Portfolio Target","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Before graduation, aim to have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Psychology foundation"},{"text":"Organizational psychology project"},{"text":"Recruitment simulation"},{"text":"Job-description portfolio"},{"text":"Structured interview framework"},{"text":"Employee onboarding system"},{"text":"Performance-management framework"},{"text":"Employee engagement survey"},{"text":"HR analytics dashboard"},{"text":"Attrition analysis"},{"text":"People analytics project"},{"text":"HRIS/ATS workflow understanding"},{"text":"HR policy samples"},{"text":"Employee communication samples"},{"text":"Internship experience"},{"text":"HR-focused resume"},{"text":"Professional LinkedIn profile"},{"text":"Final HR/People Analytics capstone"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology","Psychology Foundations","Social Psychology","Personality","Motivation","Organizational Behaviour","Industrial Psychology","HR Fundamentals","Recruitment","Selection","Interviewing","Onboarding","Performance Management","Employee Engagement","Employee Relations","HR Operations","HR Analytics","Excel","Power BI","SQL","HRIS/ATS","AI-Assisted HR","Internship","HR Associate/HR Executive","Senior HR Executive","HR Manager","HR Business Partner / HR Lead","Head of HR"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important pathway note","text":"If the student's primary goal is corporate HR, Applied/Organizational Psychology should be prioritized over Neuropsychology, and an MBA/PGDM in HR or a relevant HR/organizational-psychology master's can strengthen progression into managerial HR roles."},{"type":"p","text":"| 1584 | UG | Humanities & Social Sciences | BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours) | Applied Psychology / Counselling / Neuropsychology | Research Assistant | |"}]}]}